    "mode": 0,
    "title": "Orange 19 Listening - Test 2 - Listening Passage 2",
    "status": "published",
    "time": 8,
    "quiz_code": "",
    "parts": [
      {
        "id": 6495,
        "quiz_id": 6384,
        "passage": 2,
        "title": "Listening Passage 2",
        "sort": 2,
        "content": "Listening Passage 2",
        "explanations": [],
        "questions": [],
        "vocabs": [
          {
            "id": 895536,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895537,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I never really planned to be a lifeboat volunteer when I came to live in Northsea.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 71.99,
                  "from": 67.909996,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895553,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I’d been working in London as a website designer, but although that was interesting, I didn’t like city life.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 79.945,
                  "from": 72.825,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895572,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I’d been really keen on boats as a teenager, and I thought if I went to live by the sea, I might be able to pursue that interest a bit more in my free time.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 89.939995,
                  "from": 80.505,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895606,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Then I found that the Lifeboat Institution was looking for volunteers, so I decided to apply.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 96.579994,
                  "from": 90.659996,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895623,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895624,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The Lifeboat Institution building here in Northsea’s hard to miss, it’s one of the largest in the country.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 104.715,
                  "from": 97.619995,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895643,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It was built 15 years ago with funds provided by a generous member of the public who’d lived here all her life.",
                "youpass_pick_words": [
                  "generous"
                ],
                "meta": {
                  "to": 111.674995,
                  "from": 105.195,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895665,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "As the Lifeboat Institution is a charity that relies on that kind of donation, rather than funding provided by the government, that was a huge help to us.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 121.39,
                  "from": 112.314995,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895692,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895693,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "When I applied, I had to have a health assessment.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 125.46999,
                  "from": 122.27,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895703,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The doctors were particularly interested in my vision.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 128.83,
                  "from": 125.95,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895712,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I used to be short-sighted, so I’d had to wear glasses, but I’d had laser eye surgery two years earlier so that was OK.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 137.765,
                  "from": 129.525,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895737,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They gave me tests for colour blindness and they thought I might have a problem there, but it turned out I was OK.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 145.125,
                  "from": 138.325,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895760,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895761,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "When the coastguard gets an alert, all the volunteers are contacted and rush to the lifeboat station.",
                "youpass_pick_words": [
                  "alert"
                ],
                "meta": {
                  "to": 152.78001,
                  "from": 146.7,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895779,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Our target’s to get there in five minutes, then we try to get the boat off the dock and out to sea in another six to eight minutes.",
                "youpass_pick_words": [
                  "dock"
                ],
                "meta": {
                  "to": 162.445,
                  "from": 153.26,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895804,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Our team’s proud that we usually achieve that - the average time across the country’s eight and a half minutes.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 169.245,
                  "from": 162.925,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895824,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895825,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I’ve recently qualified as what’s called a ’helmsman’, which means I have the ultimate responsibility for the lifeboat.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 178.62001,
                  "from": 170.94,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895843,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I have to check that the equipment we use is in working order - the crew have special life jackets that can support up to four people in the water.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 187.91501,
                  "from": 179.01999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895874,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And it’s ultimately my decision whether it’s safe to launch the boat.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 192.475,
                  "from": 188.39499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895887,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But it’s very rare not to launch it, even in the worst weather.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 196.47499,
                  "from": 193.035,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895901,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895902,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "As well as going out on the lifeboat, my work involves other things too.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 202.36,
                  "from": 197.79999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895918,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "A lot of people underestimate how quickly conditions can change at sea, so I speak to youth groups and sailing clubs in the area about the sorts of problems that sailors and swimmers can have if the weather suddenly gets bad.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 217.155,
                  "from": 202.84,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 895960,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We also have a lot of volunteers who organise activities to raise money for us, and we couldn’t manage without them.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 225.635,
                  "from": 217.955,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 895981,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 895982,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The training we get is a continuous process, focusing on technical competence and safe handling techniques, and it’s given me the confidence to deal with extreme situations without panicking. I was glad I’d done a first aid course before I started, as that’s a big help with the casualty care activities we do.",
                "youpass_pick_words": [
                  "casualty"
                ],
                "meta": {
                  "to": 284.305,
                  "from": 262.42,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 896034,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We’ve done a lot on how to deal with ropes and tie knots - that’s an essential skill.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 291.48,
                  "from": 285.72,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 896051,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "After a year, I did a one-week residential course, led by specialists.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 297.32,
                  "from": 292.28,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 896062,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They had a wave-tank where they could create extreme weather conditions - so we could get experience at what to do if the boat turned over in a storm at night, for example.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 308.285,
                  "from": 297.805,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 896093,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 896094,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Since I started, I’ve had to deal with a range of emergency situations.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 314.34003,
                  "from": 309.565,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 896109,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But the work’s hugely motivating.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 317.46002,
                  "from": 314.90002,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 896115,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It’s not just about saving lives - I’ve learned a lot about the technology involved.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 323.30002,
                  "from": 317.7,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 896129,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "My background in IT’s been useful here, and I can use my expertise to help other volunteers.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 330.52502,
                  "from": 324.20502,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 896147,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They’re a great group - we’re like a family really, which helps when you’re dragging yourself out of bed on a cold stormy night.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 338.685,
                  "from": 331.005,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 896168,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But actually, it’s the colder months that can be the most rewarding time.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 344.2,
                  "from": 339.56,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 896182,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "That’s when the incidents tend to be more serious, and you realise that you can make a huge difference to the outcome.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 351.32,
                  "from": 344.76,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 896204,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 896205,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So if any of you listeners are interested....",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 355.48502,
                  "from": 352.285,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
